    <content>
      <![CDATA[<h2 id="1-1-数据类型"><a href="#1-1-数据类型" class="headerlink" title="1.1 数据类型"></a>1.1 数据类型</h2><p>C# 是强类型语言，常用类型包括值类型和引用类型：</p><ul><li>值类型：<code>int</code>、<code>float</code>、<code>bool</code>、<code>struct</code></li><li>引用类型：<code>class</code>、<code>string</code>、数组</li></ul><div class="note info flat"><p>值类型分配在栈上，复制时拷贝整个值；引用类型分配在堆上，复制的只是引用地址。</p></div><h2 id="1-2-方法定义"><a href="#1-2-方法定义" class="headerlink" title="1.2 方法定义"></a>1.2 方法定义</h2><figure class="highlight csharp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title">Calculator</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 两个整数相加</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="function"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="built_in">int</span> <span class="title">Add</span>(<span class="params"><span class="built_in">int</span> a, <span class="built_in">int</span> b</span>)</span></span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> a + b;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="1-3-属性"><a href="#1-3-属性" class="headerlink" title="1.3 属性"></a>1.3 属性</h2><figure class="highlight csharp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title">Player</span></span><br><span class="line">&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 私有字段</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">private</span> <span class="built_in">int</span> _hp;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// 公开属性，带访问控制</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="built_in">int</span> Hp</span><br><span class="line">    &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">get</span> =&gt; _hp;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">set</span> =&gt; _hp = Math.Clamp(<span class="keyword">value</span>, <span class="number">0</span>, <span class="number">100</span>);</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="1-4-总结"><a href="#1-4-总结" class="headerlink" title="1.4 总结"></a>1.4 总结</h2><ul><li>值类型存栈，引用类型存堆</li><li>属性是字段的安全访问方式</li><li>后续文章会继续介绍泛型、委托、LINQ 等内容</li></ul>]]>
    </content>
